This project provides an AionUi skill wrapper for the agent-browser CLI tool.
The agent-browser binary itself is NOT redistributed here — install it separately:
    npm install -g agent-browser

Upstream Project:
  agent-browser
  Author: Vercel Labs
  Repository: https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser
